The preceding code uses the ApplyConfiguration extension method to apply
configurations to the SQL schema during the runtime execution. It is important to note that
the OnModelCreating method implemented in the class always calls the
base.OnModelCreating method of the parent class, in order to preserve the behavior of
the extended class.
Generating a schema for the Artist and Genre entities
The preceding process can also be applied to the Artist and Genre entities. The following
