Here, TestCatalogContext class extends the CatalogContext class present in the
Catalog.Infrastructure project, and overrides the OnModelCreating method to call
the Seed<T> extension method on our entities. Consequently, when a consumer initializes
the database using TestCatalogContext, it will have all the prepopulated data written in
