The LoadDataAttribute class overrides GetData(MethodInfo testMethod);, which is
supplied by the DataAttribute class, and it returns the data utilized by the test methods.
The implementation of the GetData method reads the content of the file defined by
the _filePath attribute; it tries to serialize the content of the specified section of the file
into a generic object. Finally, the implementation calls the ToObject method to convert
the generic JObject into the type associated with the first parameter of the test
method. The last step in the process is to create a new JSON file called record-data.json
